* AD8092 Non-inverting Amplifier
V1 VCC 0 5
V2 VEE 0 -5
V3 IN 0 SINE(0 100m 1Meg) AC 1

* AD8092 Op-Amp (Pinout: IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT)
X1 IN VM VCC VEE OUT AD8092

* Feedback Network (Gain = 1 + Rf/Rg = 5 V/V)
Rf OUT VM 400
Rg VM 0 100

* Output Load
RL OUT 0 1k

* Transient Analysis (5 cycles at 1 MHz)
.tran 0 5u 0 1n

* Measurements for Gain
.meas tran in_pp PP V(IN) FROM=2u TO=5u
.meas tran out_pp PP V(OUT) FROM=2u TO=5u
.meas tran gain_db param 20*log10(out_pp/in_pp)

.end
